# GoHighLevel inbound webhook for Complexity Score quiz leads.
# In GHL: Automation -> Workflows -> new workflow -> trigger "Inbound Webhook",
# then copy the webhook URL it gives you and paste it below.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the value. .env.local is gitignored.
# On the host (Vercel etc.) set the same variable in the project settings.
GHL_WEBHOOK_URL=
